Changes made in OctoDash-Laser (starting from OctoDash v2.8.0):
- New laser screens, services and design system: src/components/laser/,
  src/services/laser/, src/model/laser.model.ts, src/laser.scss
- Routing, configuration schema/defaults, socket and config services adapted for
  GRBL lasers via OctoPrint + Better Grbl Support
- Settings, notifications, standby screen and setup wizard restyled; 3D-printer
  pages and the upstream update check removed
- Logo derived from the OctoDash logo (red laser line with a hot spot along the ring); app icon and favicon replaced
- Packaging renamed to octodash-laser; install/update/remove scripts adapted
- test-env/ (OctoPrint + Better Grbl Support + grbl-sim) and
  scripts/check-laser-i18n.py added

